    "title": "Somerville Residents Invited to Donate to Community Food Pantry Through December 10 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "5 hours ago The Good Shepherd Lutheran Church Food Pantry is collecting non-perishable food and basic care items for Somerville families facing food insecurity. Donations can be dropped off at Somerville Borough Hall, 25 West End Avenue, from November 1 to December 10, 2025, during weekday business hours.\nPriority items include canned goods, pasta, rice, peanut butter, shelf-stable milk, cereal, toilet paper, and diapers. All donations will support local residents in need. For questions, contact Sara Perez, Payroll, Tax and Finance Clerk.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
